{'symbol': 'BLK', 'date': '2020-12-29 21:10:00', 'title': 'BLACKROCK® CANADA ANNOUNCES FINAL DECEMBER CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES® ETFS', 'text': 'TORONTO, DEC. 29, 2020 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- BLACKROCK ASSET MANAGEMENT CANADA LIMITED (“BLACKROCK CANADA”), AN INDIRECT, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF BLACKROCK, INC. (NYSE: BLK), TODAY ANNOUNCED THE FINAL DECEMBER CASH DISTRIBUTIONS FOR THE ISHARES ETFS LISTED ON THE TSX OR NEO. UNITHOLDERS OF RECORD OF A FUND ON DECEMBER 31, 2020 WILL RECEIVE CASH DISTRIBUTIONS PAYABLE IN RESPECT OF THAT FUND ON JANUARY 6, 2021.'}